# 自定义直连 · 个人补充（先于 ChinaMax 匹配，可强制直连）
# 用法: 直接在下面加规则行, 行尾策略名不用改(导入时被 force-policy 覆盖)
#   host-suffix, example.cn, Direct     → 该域名及所有子域名
#   host, api.example.cn, Direct        → 仅精确域名
#   host-keyword, example, Direct       → 含关键字即命中(慎用)
#   ip-cidr, 203.0.113.0/24, Direct     → IPv4 段
# 提交后 QX → 分流页 → 全部更新 即生效

# ↓↓↓ 在这条线以下添加你的规则 ↓↓↓
host-suffix, mc.meituan.com, Direct
host-suffix, meituan.com, Direct
host-suffix, dianping.com, Direct
host-suffix, aliyundrive.com, Direct
host-suffix, aliyun.com, Direct
host-suffix, taobao.com, Direct
host-suffix, jd.com, Direct
host-suffix, bilibili.com, Direct
host-suffix, biliapi.net, Direct
host-suffix, bilivideo.com, Direct
host-suffix, qingque.cn, Direct
host-suffix, zhihu.com, Direct
host-suffix, zhimg.com, Direct
host-suffix, xiaohongshu.com, Direct
host-suffix, xhscdn.com, Direct
